# VS Code Shortcuts

Ctrl + Shift + P
→ Opens Command Palette.

Ctrl + W
→ Closes the current file/tab.

Ctrl + Tab
→ Switches between open tabs.

Ctrl + S
→ Saves the file.

Ctrl + X
→ Removes/cuts the current line when nothing is selected.

Ctrl + P
→ Quickly opens a file.

Alt + Up / Down
→ Moves the current line up or down.

Shift + Alt + Up / Down
→ Duplicates the current line.

Ctrl + D
→ Selects the next occurrence of the selected word.

